347. 372.7599999999999909 Td
(Under O.C.G.A. § 9-11-4, proper service of process is required for) Tj
T* (the court to acquire personal jurisdiction. A motion challenging) Tj
T* (service raises a jurisdictional issue; the defendant cannot be) Tj
T* (defaulted until the court conclusively determines whether service was) Tj
T* (proper. The plaintiff bears the burden of proving valid service once) Tj
T* (challenged \(IMC Construction Co., Inc. v. Mitchell, 365 Ga. App. 470) Tj
T* (\(2022\)\)) Tj
ET
