347. 293.9599999999999795 Td
(Defendant Entitled to Hearing When Service Is Disputed) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 7.1 Tf
8.5999999999999996 TL
0. g
347. 285.3599999999999568 Td
(Georgia law does not compel an automatic evidentiary hearing in) Tj
T* (every contested service matter. However, where service is factually) Tj
T* (disputed, the defendant is entitled to request a hearing, and it is) Tj
T* (proper for the court, in its discretion, to hold one to resolve conflicting) Tj
T* (evidence regarding jurisdiction. This approach is consistent with the) Tj
T* (court's inherent authority and the Uniform Superior Court Rules) Tj
T* (governing motions to quash) Tj
ET
