(Unlike Florida law, Georgia provides no statute staying unrelated) Tj
T* (procedural or substantive obligations \(e.g., deposit, escrow, or) Tj
T* (rent-related duties\) during a pending challenge to service. Any such) Tj
T* (stay must be specifically ordered by the court.) Tj
